      "dcterms:title": "Kinds of explicit consent (HL7 ActConsentDirective)",
      "dcterms:description": "The HL7 v3 ActConsentDirective codes for consent the holder gives by their own act: opt-in, opt-in with restrictions, opt-out, opt-out with exceptions. Each code's definition is HL7's (terminology.hl7.org, CodeSystem v3-ActCode).",
