      "dcterms:identifier": "ValueSet/PHWImpliedConsentKind",
      "dcterms:title": "Kinds of implied consent (HL7 ActConsentDirective)",
      "dcterms:description": "The HL7 v3 ActConsentDirective codes for consent presumed from the holder's behaviour: implied consent, implied consent with opportunity to dissent, and notice of privacy practices. Each code's definition is HL7's (terminology.hl7.org, CodeSystem v3-ActCode).",
      "dcterms:type": "Terminology: Value Sets",
      "schema:sameAs": {
